        <section class="purchase-form-card payment-card"><div class="purchase-form-section-head"><div><h2>Payment</h2><p>Record a payment now or leave the purchase as supplier debt.</p></div></div><div class="settlement-options"><label><input type="radio" name="settlement_type" value="DEBT" checked onchange="syncPurchasePayment()"><span><strong>Record as Debt</strong><small>No payment is recorded now. The full value remains payable.</small></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="settlement_type" value="PAID" onchange="syncPurchasePayment()"><span><strong>Paid</strong><small>Record a full or partial payment with this purchase.</small></span></label></div><div id="paidPurchaseFields" class="paid-purchase-fields" hidden><label>Payment Amount <span id="paymentAmountHint">Defaults to the full purchase total</span><input type="number" name="payment_amount" id="purchasePaymentAmount" min=".0001" step=".0001" placeholder="0.00" oninput="markPaymentAmountEdited()"></label><div class="purchase-payment-preview" id="purchasePaymentPreview"><span>Balance after this payment</span><strong id="purchaseRemainingBalance">0.00 <?php echo e($currency); ?></strong><small id="purchasePaymentWarning" hidden>Payment amount cannot be greater than the purchase total.</small></div><label>Payment Method<select name="payment_method" id="purchasePaymentMethod" onchange="syncPurchasePayment()"><option value="CASH">Cash</option><option value="MOBILE_MONEY">Phone / Mobile Money</option><option value="BANK_TRANSFER">Bank Transfer</option></select></label><label id="phonePaymentField" hidden>Telephone Number<input type="tel" name="payment_phone" id="paymentPhone" maxlength="32" placeholder="Telephone number used for payment"></label><div id="bankPaymentFields" class="bank-payment-fields" hidden><label>Bank Name<input name="bank_name" id="paymentBankName" maxlength="150" placeholder="Name of the bank"></label><label>Bank Account Number<input name="bank_account_number" id="paymentBankAccount" maxlength="120" placeholder="Account number used"></label></div><label id="paymentReferenceField">Payment Reference <span>Optional</span><input name="payment_reference" maxlength="120" placeholder="Receipt or transaction reference"></label><label>Payment Notes <span>Optional</span><textarea name="payment_notes" rows="2" maxlength="500" placeholder="Additional payment details"></textarea></label><div class="payment-method-note" id="paymentMethodNote">Cash payments require no additional details.</div></div><div class="debt-note" id="debtNote"><strong>Supplier debt</strong><p>This purchase will show as unpaid, with the full amount available for future payment tracking.</p></div></section>

